{"resourceIdentifier":"1953","resourceName":"Floresta Verde REDD+ Project","description":"The project preserves 53 ,528  hectares in a critical region of the eastern amazon biome.  A region where there is high deforestation risk.   The project has quantifiable CCB benefits, as it provides full time employment, training and access for the families that live in and around the project area, to be self-empowered in a region where there are few job opportunities. The project also provides cookstoves with chimneys to help mitigate lung cancer and more efficiently burn fuel for cooking.  PUBLIC COMMENT PERIOD: This project was open for public comment from 29 October – 28 November 2019.   1)CCB_PRJ_DES_SUM_POR_DRAFT_1953_27OCT2019 2)CCB_PRJ_DES_SUM_ENG_DRAFT_1653_26OCT2019 3)Draft_REDD_CCB_VCS_Summary_MR_for_public_comments.pdf  4) Draft_REDD_MR_for_public_comments_portuguese.pdf\r\n\r\nIn June 2022, this project changed its name from The ARC REDD+ Project to the Floresta Verde REDD+ Project.","location":{"latitude":-3.253889,"longitude":-47.116388},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-01-10","endExclusive":"2023-02-10","endInclusive":"2023-02-09"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1953"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Para"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Floresta Verde Serviços Ltda."},{"type":"string","value":"Paragominas, Brazil"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1953"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1953"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"340000"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":119549}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agricultu